"Uses the Utopia Planitia board and its map-specific rules and content"
CLASS UtopiaPlanitiaMapOption : MarsMapOption

"Uses the Terra Cimmeria board and its map-specific rules and content"
CLASS TerraCimmeriaMapOption : MarsMapOption

"Terra Cimmeria's MSL Curiosity placement bonus; its colony branch exists only with Colonies"
CLASS TcColonyBonus : Signal {
  This IF Class<ColoniesExpansion>: Colony<>, -5
}
